                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 674.84A/4–1256. Confidential; Niact.
                    Received at 8:08 a.m. Repeated niact to Cairo and priority to Amman, Beirut,
                    Baghdad, Damascus, London, Paris, and Tel Aviv.</p>
